<node id="OpenStax">
  <data key="d0">OpenStax</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">OpenStax is a nonprofit educational technology initiative based at Rice University, dedicated to improving educational access and learning. It provides free, peer-reviewed, and openly licensed textbooks designed for college courses, along with personalized courseware aimed at enhancing student engagement and success. OpenStax strives to offer flexible educational resources that cater to both students and educators, thereby supporting academic achievement and broadening access to quality educational materials.</data>
