  <data key="d0">Rice University</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Rice University is a leading private research university located in Houston, Texas. It is recognized for its commitment to undergraduate education and its path-breaking research contributions. The university fosters a diverse community that encourages learning and discovery among its students. Additionally, Rice University supports OpenStax, an initiative aimed at expanding access to educational resources. Overall, Rice University stands out for its dedication to academic excellence and innovative studies.</data>
